No suprise, by disabling de, your miata uses the dc driver. Therefore
you need /etc/hostname.dc0 instead of /etc/hostname.de0.
Just in case i forget to disable de in a new kernel i have all two
configuration files above, this way i can log in remotely no matter what
the interface name is.

For the Login Failure i guess you have a really, really bad
kernel/userland mismatch or overwrote something essential in /etc (like
password files?).

Regards,
Martin

